Package: guix-install
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10)
Recommends: python3-tk, sudo, curl, wget, gnupg, xz-utils
Description: install GNU Guix from any GNU/Linux distribution
 Native GUI and terminal installer for the Guix package manager and for
 Guix System. Plans are read-only and disk installation always requires
 the exact device name, with busy and protected disks refused.
